1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,599
Sensei! Sensei! I'm sorry!

2
00:00:14,599 --> 00:00:17,800
Mano, hurry. You have to get out of here.

3
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:19,800
But...

4
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:23,800
Listen carefully. It's not your fault.

5
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:25,800
Sensei...

6
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:31,600
Run, Mano. No matter what happens, stay alive.

7
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:36,600
Let's go, Mano. It's dangerous here.
